    {"parameters": {"content": "## Use Case 3 POC: Retention & Re-Engagement\n\nFetches all clients from the Data Table, checks each one against two independent thresholds (8 weeks since last visit, 30 days since last purchase), drafts a personalized nudge with AI for whichever threshold is crossed, and sends it via Resend.\n\nA client can trigger both branches (e.g. Sophie Wagner), one, or neither (e.g. Felix Braun).\n\n**Demo limits vs. production:** the \"Override Email For Test\" node redirects every send to one real inbox for testing, and uses Resend's built-in onboarding@resend.dev test sender. Production would remove that override node and use a verified sending domain instead.", "height": 660, "width": 452, "color": 4}, "id": "cd0f08c9-6b7f-46c6-9f19-866c4855f62b", "name": "Sticky Note", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-16, -80]}
